Description: start the demo in a window
 The demo only starts in fullscreen, which could be annoying, so it is
 started in windowed mode. Closing the window (SDL_QUIT) now also ends the
 demo, like a key press.
Author: Nicolas HOUDELOT <nicolas@demosdebs.org>
Assisted-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-12
